display_name = "GX-4 Gauss Arm"
description = "The right forearm is a prosthetic coilgun. Raise it and the hand folds into a fork, the forearm opens, and six drive coils slide out along telescoping rails. Ten rounds of a 40 g slug at 3.2 km/s: it goes through people and thin cover. Select it on the D-pad, LB to raise or fold it, RT to fire. Rounds refill one by one while it's folded."
